  "Run": "실행",
  "Run `npx ruflo metaharness drift-from-history --alert-on-new-severity high`. Report only a change from the last tick.": "`npx ruflo metaharness drift-from-history --alert-on-new-severity high`를 실행하세요. 지난 틱과 달라진 점만 보고하세요.",
  "Run `npx ruflo metaharness flywheel run --proposer auto --max-concurrency 2`, then list the new receipts. Do not promote anything.": "`npx ruflo metaharness flywheel run --proposer auto --max-concurrency 2`를 실행한 뒤 새 영수증을 나열하세요. 아무것도 승격하지 마세요.",
